  "method": "Reviewed disassembly of calls through scanf-family PLT/GOT entries on both architectures and calls to exported scanf-family entrypoints within glibc. Correlated CPython and OpenSSL sources. ARM64 stack-spilled format addresses at libselinux offsets 0x13750/0x1d988 and _remote_debugging offset 0x3108 were followed manually to constant data. This is a human-reviewed evidence record, not an automatic reachability proof.",
  "scope": "Shipped Extra CODEOWNERS behavior. Does not cover arbitrary commands, SQL, FFI, native plugins, or custom application code. Re-review changed native binaries or newly exposed format-taking APIs; hashes identify the binaries inspected, not a promise about later wheel builds.",
